meta {
	name: 05_ConsumerAndSystemUserOrgMismatch
	seq: 5
}

docs {
	Scenario: The consumer must be the organisation that owns the system user

		Given a system user token where the consumer claim is a KOMM, FYLK or STAT organisation
		And systemuser_org is a different organisation
		When the system user requests a package, the request fails with 403
		When the system user lists its sent requests, the request fails with 403
		When the system user withdraws a request, the request fails with 403

	No step creates state, so the scenario needs no cleanup.
}
